  <title>About ThoughtFlow — Free Voice Notes, Instructions & Use Cases</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Learn how ThoughtFlow provides unlimited, free speech-to-text dictation with no sign-ups or paywalls. Read instructions, privacy details, and popular use cases." />
